{"sourceUrl":"https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/2025/0623/c13018a412310/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.898627+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/2025/0623/c13018a412310/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span>为促进资源、生态、环境及相关领域优秀大学生的交流，增强其对华南农业大学资源环境学院相关专业的兴趣，帮助其深入了解学院的科研平台与学科优势，同时选拔具有培养潜力的优秀学生继续深造，我院将于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>8-10</span></span><span><span><span><span>日在广州举办优秀大学生夏令营活动。欢迎有志报考我院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年硕士研究生的优秀大学生踊跃报名参加。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、</span></span><span><span><strong>学院简介</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>华南农业大学是国家“双一流”建设高校，资源环境学院是“双一流”建设的主要支撑学院。学院办学近百年，学术底蕴深厚。建有</span></span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span><span>个省部级以上和多个广东省高等学校科技创新平台等。目前拥有农业资源与环境、生态学、环境科学与工程</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>个一级学科。其中，农业资源与环境和生态学为广东省优势重点学科，农业资源与环境是作物学“双一流”建设的重要支撑学科。土地利用工程为学校唯一获批的教育部交叉学科。此外，学院牵头建设低碳农业学科、参与的智慧农业学科，是广东省高水平大学重点学科建设单位。目前，</span></span></span></span><span><span>ESI“</span></span><span><span><span><span>环境科学与生态学”学科排名前</span></span></span></span><span><span>1.89‰</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院现有教职工</span></span></span></span><span><span>149</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，其中教授</span></span></span></span><span><span>35</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、副教授</span></span></span></span><span><span>65</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，博士后</span></span></span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，博士学位教师占</span></span></span></span><span><span>89%</span></span><span><span><span><span>。拥有国家杰出青年学者、国家优秀青年学者、教育部长江青年学者、国家教学名师、全国优秀教师、广东省珠江学者、广东省杰出青年学者等国家级以及省部级高层次人才近</span></span></span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span><span>人。学院设有</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>个系，涵盖土壤科学、植物营养、生态学、环境科学与工程、测绘与地理信息等方向。现开设</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>个本科专业，其中生态学和环境工程为国家一流专业。学院拥有</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>个一级学科博士授权点（农业资源与环境、生态学），</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>个一级学科硕士学位授权点（农业资源与环境、生态学、环境科学与工程），建立了</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>个博士后科研流动站（农业资源与环境、生态学）。农业资源与环境、生态学已形成了“学士</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>硕士</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>博士</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>博士后”全程人才培养体系。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>广州是粤港澳大湾区的核心引擎城市之一，既是国家中心城市，也是国家高质量发展和对外开放的重要门户。学校地处广州市中心的天河区，区位优越、交通便利，毗邻多个科研院所和创新企业集群，拥有良好的学术与产业资源，为学习、科研与未来发展提供了广阔平台。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年拟招收的硕士研究生专业包括土壤学、植物营养学、生态学、环境科学与工程、土地利用工程学术型硕士，以及资源与环境（环境工程、测绘工程）、资源利用与植物保护专业型硕士，具体以学校正式发布为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、夏令营安排</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  1.时间安排：</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>日报到，</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>9-10</span></span><span><span><span><span>日正式活动。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  2.夏令营期间，将开展开营仪式、学校和学院介绍、实验室展示、名家讲座、师生交流、优秀大学生个人风采展示等环节，切身感受学院学科建设、科学研究、研究生培养和专家风采等百年名校综合魅力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  3.夏令营期间统一安排营员就餐；广州市外高校学生在营期间住宿由学院统一安排；非本校广州市区学生不安排住宿，每天补助交通费</span></span></span></span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span><span><span>元；本校学生不安排住宿不补助交通费；广州市外高校学生报销车票（从学校或家庭所在地到广州的往返，含汽车、普通硬卧车票、或动车高铁二等座车票，上限800元），不予报销飞机票。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  1.拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，遵纪守法，诚实守信，品德良好，身心健康；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  2.全国</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年本科应届毕业生；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  3.学习成绩优秀，本科前两年半平均绩点</span></span></span></span><span><span>3.0</span></span><span><span><span><span>以上，专业课成绩平均为</span></span></span></span><span><span>80</span></span><span><span><span><span>分以上，且有意到华南农业大学资源环境学院深造的同学；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  4.具有较强的英语能力，英语四级成绩在</span></span></span></span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span><span><span>分以上，通过英语六级者优先考虑；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  5.科研能力突出者申请成绩标准可适当放宽（需提供获奖证书、优秀实验设计或发表论文等相关证明材料）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>四、申请方式及材料</strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  1.本届计划招收营员</span></span></span></span><span><span>30-50</span></span><span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  2.申请时间：即日起开始报名，报名截止时间为</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span>17:30</span></span><span><span><span><span>，逾期不再接受申请。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  3.申请方式：请在报名截至日期前将以下电子版材料压缩打包发至邮箱</span></span></span></span><span><span>827569440@qq.com</span></span><span><span><span><span>（闫老师）。文件夹、邮件标题为：所在学校全称</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>本人姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></span><span><span>-2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营申请。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  4.所需材料：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>，加盖所在单位公章）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）个人陈述</span></span></span></span><span><span>Word</span></span><span><span><span><span>电子版（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩证明：前两年半的学习成绩单扫描件、绩点排名证明（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>，加盖学校教务部门的学习成绩专用章）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>）英语水平证明：国家英语四、六级考试成绩或</span></span></span></span><span><span>TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/</span></span><span><span><span><span>雅思等成绩（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>）身份证（正反面）、学生证（照片页和信息页）（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>）获奖经历证明：本科在读期间各类获奖情况，按照学业科研获奖、德育获奖和文体获奖分类建立文件夹（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>）具有副高级职称及以上的专家推荐信</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>封（签字、扫描件），专家推荐信参考模板见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>）华南农业大学资源环境学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营报名信息汇总表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五、注意事项</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  1.报名结束后，学院将进行资格审核，择优录取，营员录取名单将在资源环境学院网站上公布，请营员在招生期间密切关注我院网站信息；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  2.学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人参营资格，并通报给学生所在学校主管部门，同时保留进一步追溯的权利；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  3.参加夏令营的学生必须遵守华南农业大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排全程参加夏令营各项活动，如发现无故缺勤者，取消营员资格；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  4.活动具体安排如有调整，届时将及时通知入选学员。欢迎加入【华南农业大学资源环境学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营】微信交流群，（请以“所在学校</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span>+2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营”申请进群），夏令营具体安排将通过交流群发布；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>  5.其他未尽事宜由华南农业大学资源环境学院负责解释。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系人：闫老师</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>020-85280293</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span>827569440@qq.com</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>微信咨询交流群（附后）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>资源环境学院网页（</span></span></span></span><span><span>https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span><span><span>），招生信息请扫描关注华南农业大学研招办公众号查询了解或者参阅华南农业大学研究生院网页（</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://yjsglxt.scau.edu.cn/open/RecruitTkss/ZsDir_View.aspx</span></span><span><span><span><span>）。 </span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4f/b2/c15cda7e4886aafa0e45bb447093/c555f0d9-feb5-47cf-9f05-9732ccb182d0.png\" title=\"\"/></p></td><td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4f/b2/c15cda7e4886aafa0e45bb447093/9e4417b9-73c7-4c38-93ae-808498a5a58f.png\"/></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>资源环境学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营报名交流群</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>     <span><span><span>华南农业大学研招办</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>：华南农业大学资源环境学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年全国大学生夏令营报名申请表</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>：华南农业大学资源环境学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年全国大学生夏令营报名个人陈述</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>：绩点排名证明模板</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>：专家推荐信（参考模板）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>：华南农业大学资源环境学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营报名信息汇总表</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_rar.gif\"/><a href=\"https://zyhjxy.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/4f/b2/c15cda7e4886aafa0e45bb447093/eaefdccc-7a65-451d-af85-1be9fbdd8b67.zip\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"2025夏令营通知-附件.zip\">2025夏令营通知-附件.zip</a><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"40464c2e83df37b329581928fa7b4af7160cd0a557248af0999c1b8e45e5c958","textLength":2639,"sourceSha256":"2a311de419ae825acf924b9482d1f18feef2a0a33ffc4e5ba7a5ed4a0af2d704","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-faa8ae580e6ae144264e","title":"2025年华南农业大学资源环境学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.898627+00:00"}
